73A. Definitions.
In this Chapter, —
(a) “other beneficiaries” means persons other than the person insured under this Act;
(b) “Scheme” means any Scheme framed by the Central Government from time to time
under section 73-B for the medical facility for other beneficiaries;
(c) “underutilised hospital” means any hospital not fully utilised by the persons insured
under this Act;
(d) “user charges” means th e amount which is to be charged f rom the other
beneficiaries for med ical facilities as may be notified by the Corporation in
consultation with the Central Government from time to time.
